# Firmware Build

Use only the Run's pinned source revision, execution target and approved build profile.

1. Validate the source revision and clean fixture policy.
2. Run the approved build command through the selected execution backend.
3. On failure, return a stable failure code and bounded log references; do not report a deploy result. Lease retention or release follows the actual Board Farm MCP policy.
4. On success, calculate the artifact SHA-256 digest.
5. Return artifact ID, digest, sanitized locator, timestamps and bounded log references.

Never print credentials, internal endpoints or user identifiers. Do not infer success from file existence alone.
